flowchart LR
    U([User]) -->|1. upload .pdf| A[app.py]
    A -->|2. render pages @200-300dpi| P[pdf_utils.py<br/>PyMuPDF]
    P -->|thumbnails + selected pages PNG| A
    A -->|3. click Extract| G[gemini_client.py]
    G -->|images + verbatim prompt| GM[(Gemini API)]
    GM -->|raw text| G
    G -->|4. parse JSON| R{parsed OK?}
    R -->|yes| B[boq_utils.py<br/>DataFrame + unit weight]
    R -->|no| E[st.error +<br/>raw response shown]
    B --> D[5. st.data_editor<br/>user corrects AI]
    D --> X[/6. Download Excel/]
    G --> L[research_log.py]
    E --> L
    L --> J[/logs/*.json/]
    J -.scored against.-> T[/samples/ground_truth.csv/]
    T -.-> SC[score.py]
    J -.-> SC
